.TH ZEX-SWEEP 1 "2026-06-27" "zex 5.0.0" "Zainium OS"
.SH NAME
zex-sweep \- clean package cache and orphaned files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B elevate zex sweep
.RI [ \-\-dry\-run ]
.RI [ \-\-aggressive ]
.RI [ \-y ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zex sweep
reclaims disk space by removing:
.TP
\(bu
Downloaded package cache
.RI ( /overlayer/zexlib/registry/cache/ )
.TP
\(bu
Temporary files
.RI ( /overlayer/zexlib/tmp/ )
.TP
\(bu
Orphaned upgrade staging directories
.RI ( /overlayer/syshub.new/ )
.TP
\(bu
Old transaction records (keeps the 10 most recent)
.TP
\(bu
With
.BR \-\-aggressive :
log files older than 30 days
.RI ( /overlayer/zexlib/union/var/log/ )
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-n, \-\-dry\-run
Preview what would be cleaned without removing anything.
.TP
.B \-a, \-\-aggressive
Also clean old log files (> 30 days).
.TP
.B \-y, \-\-yes
Skip the confirmation prompt.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zex (1),
.BR zex-doctor (1)
